Part of "What to Wish For"

If you get an early chance for a first wish, it is strongly recommended
to choose one of the following:
 o blessed greased +2 gray dragon scale mail [GDSM - for magic
resistance]
for those without magic resistance and
 o blessed greased +2 silver dragon scale mail [SDSM - for reflection]
for wizards and others that already have magic resistance.

Either of these greatly improve your armor and can greatly improve your
chance of winning the game. The monk has extreme to-hit disadvantages
when wearing body armor, so another item like a coaligned MR granting
artifact or speed boots will be best.

An early chance for a second wish is not likely but may be time to get
reflection (if you don't have it yet) or a blessed magic marker (if you
know enchant armor) and boost your chances of survival.

