Added to "The Quest"

Based on deaths recorded on the alt.org server, I have come up with a
ranking of Quest Nemeses from "least dangerous" to "most dangerous"
based on roughly a 2:1 ratio in kill rate between each group. The
percentages are of deaths to the Nemesis compared to total ascensions
for that class.

 o 01% or less: Thoth Amon (B), Master of Thieves (T), The Dark One
(W), The Master Assassin (Ro)
 o 03% to 05%: Ixoth (K), Minion of Huhetotl (A), Chromatic Dragon (C),
Lord Surtur (V)
 o 09% to 10%: Nalzok (P), Scorpius (Ra)
 o 20% to 25%: Ashikaga Takauji (S), The Cyclops (H)
 o 45%: Master Kaen (M)



